#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1016 expect=skipped domain=IE
#note "PLAN-join-key-authoring-gate phase 3/4, sensitivity arm row 3 — EVERY key absent on both sides. Neither IE nor TI carries IETESTCD, IETEST or IECAT: every All_Or_None group is all-absent (satisfied), but the first key IETESTCD is also required in Requirements.Variables.All (§6 Q9), so the rule SKIPS. Before the gate the rule ran and JKM R7's all-absent key was an execution ERROR. Red-first: with IETESTCD removed from All this scenario fails with the rule errored."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset IE label="Inclusion/Exclusion Criteria Not Met"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col IESEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col IEORRES  type=Char label="I/E Criterion Original Result"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | IE | 01-701-1015 | 1 | N
---

dataset TI label="Trial Inclusion/Exclusion Criteria"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TIRL     type=Char label="Inclusion/Exclusion Criterion Rule"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TI | AGE >= 18
